# =================================================================
# ABox Instances extracted from:
#   Government Resolution No. 190
#   Approving submission of Cybersecurity Law amendment
#   (Arts. 1, 2, 6, 8, 9, 13, Chapter V name, annex, new
#   Art. 17 and Chapter VI) and Administrative Offences Code
#   amendment to Seimas
#   2021-03-31, Vilnius
#   Prime Minister Ingrida Šimonytė
# =================================================================

lld:GovRes-190-2021 a llo:Statute ;
    rdfs:label "Government Resolution No. 190 – Submission of Cybersecurity Law amendment (vulnerability disclosure, EU certification) to Seimas (2021)" ;
    rdfs:label "Government Resolution No. 190 – Submission of Cybersecurity Law amendment (vulnerability disclosure, EU certification) to Seimas (2021)"@en ;
    rdfs:label "Vyriausybės nutarimas Nr. 190 – Kibernetinio saugumo įstatymo pakeitimo (pažeidžiamumų atskleidimas, ES sertifikavimas) teikimas Seimui (2021)"@lt ;
    rdfs:comment "Government approves and submits to Seimas two draft laws: (1) Cybersecurity Law No. XII-1428 Arts. 1, 2, 6, 8, 9, 13 amendment, Chapter V title amendment, annex amendment, and supplementation with new Art. 17 and new Chapter VI (vulnerability disclosure and EU cybersecurity certification framework, later enacted as XIV-413), (2) Administrative Offences Code supplementation with Art. 480¹ and Art. 589 and annex amendment. Delegates Defence Minister Arvydas Anušauskas (deputy: Vice-Minister Margiris Abukevičius) to represent Government in Seimas." ;
    rdfs:comment "Government approves and submits to Seimas two draft laws: (1) Cybersecurity Law No. XII-1428 Arts. 1, 2, 6, 8, 9, 13 amendment, Chapter V title amendment, annex amendment, and supplementation with new Art. 17 and new Chapter VI (vulnerability disclosure and EU cybersecurity certification framework, later enacted as XIV-413), (2) Administrative Offences Code supplementation with Art. 480¹ and Art. 589 and annex amendment. Delegates Defence Minister Arvydas Anušauskas (deputy: Vice-Minister Margiris Abukevičius) to represent Government in Seimas."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Vyriausybė pritaria ir teikia Seimui du įstatymų projektus: (1) Kibernetinio saugumo įstatymo Nr. XII-1428 1, 2, 6, 8, 9, 13 straipsnių, V skyriaus pavadinimo, priedo pakeitimo ir papildymo 17 straipsniu ir VI skyriumi (pažeidžiamumų atskleidimas ir ES kibernetinio saugumo sertifikavimo sistema, vėliau priimta kaip XIV-413), (2) Administracinių nusižengimų kodekso papildymo 480¹ straipsniu ir 589 straipsnio bei priedo pakeitimo. Įgalioja krašto apsaugos ministrą Arvydą Anušauską atstovauti Seime."@lt ;
    llo:hasDocID "No. 190" ;
    llo:dateEnacted "2021-03-31"^^xsd:date ;
    llo:isPubliclyDisclosed true .
